<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jan-Aug aluminium exports 1.76 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russia Jan-Aug aluminium exports 1.76 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian exported 1.76 million tonnes of aluminium over the first eight months of this year, a 28 percent increase on year-ago levels, Statistics Committee figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following data for metals exports and output-</p>
<p>		RUSSIAN NON-FERROUS METALS EXPORTS</p>
<p>	     Jan-Aug 1996   pct change    Aug 1996, pct change</p>
<p>	     (tonnes)	 yr/yr	   mth/mth    yr/yr</p>
<p>Aluminium  1,756,000	+28.0	   +4.0	 +19.0</p>
<p>Copper	 353,000	+28.0	  -12.0	 +11.0</p>
<p>Nickel	 104,000	+12.0	  -33.0	  +3.0</p>
<p>		RUSSIAN NON-FERROUS METALS OUTPUT</p>
<p>			 Jan-Sept 1996,    Sept 1996, pct change</p>
<p>			 pct change	  mth/mth    yr/yr</p>
<p>			 yr/yr</p>
<p> Primary aluminium  +5.0		   -3.0	   0.0</p>
<p> Alumina		-2.0		   -3.0	  -9.0</p>
<p> Refined copper     +4.0		  -10.0	  -0.03</p>
<p> Copper concentrate +2.0		  -12.0	  -8.0</p>
<p> Nickel		 -4.0		   +0.02	-10.0</p>
<p> Cobalt		 -1.0		  -38.0	 -29.0</p>
<p> Zinc		   +4.0		   +8.0	 +19.0</p>
<p> Gold (mining)	-9.0		  -22.0	  -8.0</p>
<p>Note: The Statistics Committee gave no actual figures for metals output.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
